## **Summary of Recommendations**
| **Vulnerability**               | **Risk Level** | **Recommendation**                                                                 |
|----------------------------------|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| Injection                        | Low            | Use ORMs, validate/sanitize input.                                                 |
| Broken Authentication            | Medium         | Use `bcrypt`, `Passport.js`, secure sessions.                                      |
| Missing Input Validation         | Medium         | Use `express-validator`, implement rate limiting.                                  |
| Security Misconfiguration        | High           | Use `helmet`, `CORS`, disable `X-Powered-By`, set `NODE_ENV=production`.           |
| Insecure Deserialization         | Low            | Avoid unsafe `JSON.parse`, use signed tokens (JWT).                                |
| Insufficient Logging             | Medium         | Use `morgan`, `Winston` for logging.                                               |
| SSRF                             | Low            | Validate URLs, use allowlists.                                                     |
| Missing Security Headers         | High           | Use `helmet`, set CSP.                                                             |

